echttp (2.3) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix initialization of hash table.
  * Add strsame() (strcmp drives me insane).
  * Return HTTP code 204 when there is no content (avoid JavaScript exception).
  * Add stpedec(), similar to stpecpy but for integers (better performances).
  * JSON performance improvements (strncpy() is evil): use stpecpy(), strtcpy().
  * Keep a reference to the HTTP reason when code is not 200
  * Handle errors when a file does not exist.
  * Add echttp_option_csv() for multi-values options.
  * Accept null path pointer as equivalent to empty path.

 -- Pascal Martin <pascal.fb.martin@gmail.com>  Mon, 24 Aug 2026 17:23:00 -0700

echttp (2.2) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Fix the array size limit issue with echttp_json_enumerate() 
  * Use cache location conform to the FHS
  * Support 64 bit integers all the way
  * Avoid conflict with C23 bool
  * Add fast scan mechanism for subsecond polling

 -- Pascal Martin <pascal.fb.martin@gmail.com>  Tue, 13 Jan 2026 17:23:00 -0700

